    "references": [
      {
        "link": "https://world.digimoncard.com/rule/?card_no=BT7-087#qaResult_card",
        "num": 1,
        "text": "Official English Q&A for BT7-087 (Mar. 28, 2024)"
      },
      {
        "link": "https://world.digimoncard.com/rule/?card_no=BT7-087#qaResult_card",
        "num": 2,
        "text": "Official English Q&A for BT7-087 (Nov. 1, 2024)"
      }
    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "Some Digimon cards can digivolve onto Tamers. Digivolve such a Digimon onto this card, and it will become part of that Digimon’s digivolution cards, allowing you to activate this card’s inherited effect.",
        "question": "How do I activate this card’s inherited effect?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, it does.",
        "question": "Does this card's inherited effect activate when an opponent's effect returns one of my Digimon to its owner's hand?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes. The card text reads, “you may,” so you can choose to only place 5 cards with [Hybrid] in their traits under this Tamer without digivolving.",
        "question": "Can I activate this card's [Main] effect to place 5 cards with [Hybrid] in their traits under this Tamer from my hand, and then choose not to digivolve into [MagnaGarurumon]?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, you can’t.",
        "question": "If I only have 4 cards in my hand with [Hybrid] in their traits, can I activate this card's [Main] effect to place 4 cards from my hand under this Tamer without digivolving?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, it still has it. If this Digimon digivolves into a Digimon again during this turn, that Digimon can't be blocked for the turn.",
        "question": "I have P-153 [MagnaGarurumon] with this card in digivolution cards in the battle area.  I activated this card's inherited effect, then I used P-153 [MagnaGarurumon]'s [End of Attack] effect to place P-153 [MagnaGarurumon] as my top security card, and this card became the Digimon's top card.  At such times, does this card still have \"this Digimon can't be blocked for the turn\"?",
        "reference": "[2]"
      }
    ]
  },
